     "text_1": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "text": "<h3>Join Macnica at Embedded Vision Summit 2025</h3>\n<p><b>Booth&nbsp;#719&nbsp;·&nbsp;May&nbsp;20-22 ·&nbsp;Santa Clara, CA</b></p>\n<p>Macnica is proud to exhibit at the premier event for innovators building AI and computer vision into products. <b>Embedded Vision Summit</b> brings together industry leaders, engineers, and developers to explore the latest in edge AI, machine learning, and vision technologies.</p>\n<p>Visit us at <b>Booth #719</b> to experience how we’re pushing the boundaries of real-time, AI-powered analytics and product design with our partner, iENSO, and solutions from Ambarella and Sony.</p>\n<h3>What You'll See at Our Booth:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><b>GenAI in action</b>&nbsp;- iENSO will demo one of Microsoft’s popular multimodal Generative AI models running on&nbsp;<b>Ambarella’s latest on-device CV72S AI SoC</b>&nbsp;platform with the industry’s best AI performance per watt.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Smarter Vision at the Edge </b>-&nbsp;iENSO’s CV72S and CV75 vision platforms<b>&nbsp;</b>unite&nbsp;<b>Sony’s latest HDR CMOS sensors&nbsp;</b>with&nbsp;<b>Ambarella’s latest on-device CVflow® 3.0 AI SoCs</b>, delivering&nbsp;scalable, high-performance reasoning for vision AI applications.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><b>Let's talk innovation!</b></h3>\n<p>Whether you're designing next-gen robotics, smart cameras, or AI-enabled devices, we’d love to connect and show how Macnica’s ecosystem can help you accelerate development and scale smarter.</p>\n<h3>Ready for a demo or meeting with our team?&nbsp;</h3>\n<p>Fill out the form below, tell us what you’d like to discuss, and our team will confirm your meeting within one business day.</p>",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
     }
    },
